silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_02_sections_01_concrete_anchor_6#dentalquality77 silm:hasLongDescription "The DentalQuality77 is the dental quality observed at the visit (mild tartar). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'DentalQuality77', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
